			"widgets_values":[
				"The image features a person dressed in elaborate, traditional-inspired attire that appears to blend Eastern cultural motifs. The outfit primarily consists of a deep red fabric with intricate, gold embroidery depicting floral patterns and regal designs. The top is a fitted, cropped piece accentuated by ornate detailing around the bust, while the flowing sleeves and draped fabric evoke a sense of elegance and grandeur. A matching floor-length skirt or bottom completes the ensemble, showcasing the same red and gold theme.\n\nAccessories include golden jewelry—a necklace and dangling earrings—that complement the overall look. The person's hairstyle is adorned with delicate golden ornaments, including hairpins or a small crown-like accessory, which enhances the sophisticated appearance. The background is a mysterious outdoor setting, possibly a forest or garden, with dim lighting contributing to an ethereal and dramatic ambiance. The use of soft, glowing light highlights the luxurious textures of the outfit."
